---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const guides=(await getCollection('guides')).sort((a,b)=>a.id.localeCompare(b.id));
---
<Layout title="ETF Field Guides: Fees, Trading Costs and NAV Explained" description="Understand ETF expense ratios, tracking differences, bid-ask spreads and premiums to NAV with worked examples, official sources and practical comparison checks."><article class="paper"><h1>Read the fine print.</h1><p class="lead">An ETF has an ownership cost, a trading cost and a return path. These four source-reviewed guides help separate them before comparing funds.</p><p><a href="/rss.xml">Subscribe to the guide RSS feed</a></p><div class="guide-list">{guides.map(g=><section><h2><a href={'/guides/'+g.id+'/'}>{g.data.question}</a></h2><p>{g.data.answer}</p><p class="note">Updated {g.data.updated}</p></section>)}</div><p><a href="/tools/">Run a cost scenario</a> · <a href="/filings/">Inspect the partial historical SEC snapshot</a></p></article></Layout>